id=a52sxq_hw_features
name=Galaxy A52s 5G: hide Fold8 features the A52s hardware can't run
author=kusti420
description=The Fold8 product/system_ext bring options the A52s can't back: LE Audio / Auracast Bluetooth profiles and the Auracast default QS tile (stock A52s ships them all disabled), Wi-Fi Labs > Wi-Fi 7 mode (no 802.11be), Adaptive color tone (EnvironmentAdaptiveDisplay needs a colour-temperature light sensor; A52s stk31610 has none) and the Gemini Nano / AICore source SoC hardware configs (google_aicore_QC_*.xml: SM8850 on the Fold8, SM8750 + SM8850 on the S25). Restore the A52s values / hide them. Samsung DeX is not touched here: the wireless_dex patch owns it (wireless DeX on, wired DeX impossible).
